# Objective

Implement the Hero Section for the GCT Core landing page.

The Hero Section establishes the first impression of the Go Cape Tours brand and communicates the company's premium positioning through refined typography, authentic imagery and carefully balanced calls-to-action.

The Hero shall consume the DS-001 Design System and Design Tokens.

No business functionality shall be introduced.

---

# Scope

This implementation includes:

- Hero layout
- Hero imagery
- Headline
- Supporting content
- Primary CTA
- Secondary CTA
- Responsive layout
- Accessibility
- Performance optimisation

This implementation excludes:

- Booking engine
- Search
- Live availability
- Video backgrounds
- Dynamic CMS content
- API integration

